  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your body was scoured by the force of a particularly powerful or magical storm, awakening essence within you and allowing you to overcome even the most devastating of weather.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Con 13 or veilweaver level 1, Wis 13.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can invest essence into this feat. For each point of essence invested in this feat, you reduce the miss chance imposed by natural and magical weather by 5% (to a minimum of 0%), reduce any penalties to Perception checks imposed by natural and magical weather by 1 (to a minimum of 0), and reduce the damage dealt to you by natural and magic weather by 2 (to a minimum of 0). These effects also apply to Storm veils used against you.</p>\n<p>You gain 1 point of essence.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/akashic-feats#toc51\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
